### My shelves (1 = Want to read, 2 = Reading, 3 = Read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves

### Entries on the Read shelf
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/3/entries

### Unknown shelf (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/999/entries

### Id is not a number (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/abc/entries


### ---------- Entry lifecycle: run these in order, top to bottom ----------

### 1. Put book 5 on "Want to read" (201), remembers the new entry's id
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 5 }

> {%
    client.global.set("entryId", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. The same book again (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 5 }

### 3. Move it to "Read" (200, finishedAt is set)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shelfId": 3 }

### 4. Move it to the shelf it's already on (200, nothing changes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shelfId": 3 }

### 5. Move it to an unknown shelf (404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shelfId": 999 }

### 6. Delete it (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}

### 7. Delete it again (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/entries/{{entryId}}


### ---------- Invalid input ----------

### Unknown book (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 999 }

### Missing bookId (400, with errors.bookId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### Broken JSON (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/1/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId":